      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعاوذوا</span></b>  <i>They sought protection, preservation,</i>
or <i>refuge, one of another;</i> or <i>confided in,</i> or <i>relied
upon, one another's protection,</i> or <i>preservation;</i>
(A, O, L, K; *) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى الحَرْبِ</span> <i>in war.</i> (O, L.)

